    "detailed_description": "This is a fun shooting game without actual violence. You play as a Chibi Good guy or Girl, in single or co-op mode, to save the 12 worlds then protect your castle.<br>The game is a shooting action set in a fantasy world. Your general wants you to fight the bad guys. They call themselves The &quot;BAD GUYS&quot;.<br>Standard control with keyboard and mouse or a gamepad.<br>Play to get as high score as possible. You get 1 point per kill but you lose 5 points every time you die.<br>There's also a touch of puzzle to spice the game up and give you a little break from chibi action.<br><br>Enough said. NOW, Go get them Chibi!!!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977980/extras/Capture_PBC.JPG?t=1548529753\" /></div>",
